# Rebuilt by `repowise init` — 23 MB of caches, wiki.db and a knowledge graph
.repowise/

# Local Claude Code state. `rules/` stays tracked — CLAUDE.md sends readers there — while
# .claude/CLAUDE.md is rewritten by every repowise run and deleted again by the sync script.
.claude/*
!.claude/rules/

# Written back by every `repowise update`, so deleting them does not stick
.vscode/

